# Base URL for the real backend, read by lib/api.real.ts.
#
# `localhost` resolves to the PHONE, not your Mac — on a device or the iOS
# simulator you need your machine's LAN address:
#
#   ipconfig getifaddr en0
#
# Both machines must be on the same Wi-Fi. Requests that hang with no error are
# almost always this.
#
# Copy this file to `.env` and set your own address:
#
# The address is nginx (port 80), the only way into the backend — not port 3000,
# which is not reachable from outside Docker. If you changed PUBLIC_PORT in the
# root .env, add it here: http://192.168.1.42:8080
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://192.168.1.42
